   "resumo_en": "The Youngbloods is the debut studio album by the American rock band the Youngbloods. Released in January 1967, the album peaked at number 131 on the Billboard 200. Two years later, the single \"Get Together\" reached number five and sold more than a million copies. The album was reissued in 1971 under the title Get Together.",
